= BITwiki Performance Budgets =

== Hard Limits (MediaWiki Defaults) ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Metric !! Default Limit !! BITwiki Recommended !! Exceeding Consequence
|-
| Template expansion depth || 40 levels || 3-4 levels || Parse failure
|-
| Post-expand include size (PEIS) || 2,097,152 bytes || 1,048,576 bytes (50%) || Hard failure
|-
| Expensive parser functions || 100 per page || 50 per page || Parse failure
|-
| {{#ask:}} result limit || unlimited || 50 || Performance degradation
|}

