== Optimization Strategies ==

= Reduce Nesting: Flatten template call graphs =
= Limit Queries: Always specify <code>|limit=</code> on {{#ask:}} =
= Use Lua Modules: Move complex logic to Module: namespace =
= Cache Results: Use concept caching for expensive queries =
= Fragment Reuse: Prefer L1 fragments over full section transclusion =

== Validation Rules ==

'' All templates must document their depth/PEIS usage in /doc
'' Pre-import checks must validate against budgets
'' SMW queries must specify explicit limits
* Circular dependencies are prohibited (see Dependency Schema)

== Emergency Procedures ==

If PEIS exceeded:
= Identify largest transclusion via Special:ExpandTemplates =
= Replace with direct content or reduce fragment size =
= Consider splitting page into subpages =

